# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public site URL
# Used for canonical links, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, metadata and the OG image.
# Local development falls back to http://localhost:3000.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub contribution graph (optional)
# A read-only personal access token with no scopes is enough for public data.
# Create one at https://github.com/settings/tokens (classic, no scopes ticked).
# Without it the contribution graph renders a quiet empty state; the site never
# fails because of a missing token.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# No other secrets are required. LeetCode stats use a public endpoint and the
# usernames in src/content/site.ts. No autoplaying media is used anywhere.
